==== hyperbricks yaml {!{images}} ====
images:
  - type: images
  - attributes:
      loading: lazy
  - enclose: <div id="#gallery">|</div>
  - directory: hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/
  - width: "100"
==== explainer ====
Wraps the complete gallery in the configured enclosing markup.
==== expected json ====
{
  "Alt": "",
  "Class": "",
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<IMAGES>",
  "Enclose": "<div id=\"#gallery\">|</div>",
  "ExtraAttributes": {
    "loading": "lazy"
  },
  "Height": 0,
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "Id": "",
  "IsStatic": false,
  "Loading": "",
  "MetaDocDescription": "",
  "Quality": 0,
  "Directory": "hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/",
  "Title": "",
  "Width": 100
}

==== expected output ====
<div id="#gallery"><img src="/static/images/cute_cat_cf6e86a5019b7eff32b5cae8e570c67d_w100_h100.jpg" width="100" height="100" alt="" loading="lazy" />
<img src="/static/images/same_cute_cat_cf6e86a5019b7eff32b5cae8e570c67d_w100_h100.jpg" width="100" height="100" alt="" loading="lazy" /></div>
